        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 6FBS32D, 6 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brushed Stainless Steel 6\" Flush Bolt (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door and has a toggle lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. Packaged complete with stainless steel flush bolt assembly, mounting screws and strike plate. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-6FBS32D.gif?v=1704354590\" width=\"600\" height=\"262\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 6FBS32D Stainless Steel Flush Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>We also carry other size Solid Brass Flush Bolts:</b> \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-4fbs\">4\" Square Corners</a> -  \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-del-6fbs\">6\" Square Corners</a>  -  \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-round-corners-deltana-del-6fbr\">6\" Round Corners</a>  -  \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-7-inch-flush-bolt-deltana-7fbr\">7\" Round Corners</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-extension-flush-bolts-12-18-and-24-inches-deltana-del-efb\">Extension Flush Bolts in 12\", 18\", 24\"</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana 6FBS32D Flush Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Length: 5-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Thickness: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Corner: Square</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Thickness: .081\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/6FBS32D.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 6FBS32D Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Brushed Stainless Steel finish Only.\r\n</p>",
